--简单的均匀大小缩放变化事件(仅适用于目标图像hscale = vscale) 若colli为true则判定也会跟着贴图大小成比例变化
function SimSizeCh(o, size0, size1, t0, colli)
	task.New(o, function()
		local _size0, _size1, _t0 = size0 or o.hscale, size1 or o.hscale, t0 or 1
		local size, dsize = _size0, (_size1 - _size0) / _t0
		if colli and o.hscale > 0 and o.vscale > 0 then
			local a, b = o.a / o.hscale, o.b / o.vscale
			for _ = 1, _t0 do
				size = size + dsize
				o.hscale, o.vscale = size, size
				o.a, o.b = a * o.hscale, b * o.vscale
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		else
			for _ = 1, _t0 do
				size = size + dsize
				o.hscale, o.vscale = size, size
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		end
	end)
end
egg.SimSizeCh = SimSizeCh

--简单的size从0变到指定值
local function simSizeChFrom0(o, s, t, colli)
	local isColliCh = (colli and o.hscale > 0 and o.vscale > 0)
	local ds, dh, dv, da, db = s / t
	if isColliCh then
		da, db = o.a / o.hscale * ds, o.b / o.vscale * ds
		o.a, o.b = 0, 0
	end
	dh, dv = sign(o.hscale) * ds, sign(o.vscale) * ds
	o.hscale, o.vscale = 0, 0
	task.New(o, function()
		if isColliCh then
			for _ = 1, t do
				o.hscale, o.vscale = o.hscale + dh, o.vscale + dv
				o.a, o.b = o.a + da, o.b + db
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		else
			for _ = 1, t do
				o.hscale, o.vscale = o.hscale + dh, o.vscale + dv
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		end
	end)
end
egg.simSizeChFrom0 = simSizeChFrom0


--简单的消弹
function Kill_Bullet(x, y, range, indes)
	local d
	for _, o in ObjList(GROUP_ENEMY_BULLET) do
		d = Dist(x, y, o.x, o.y)
		if d <= range then
			task.New(o, function()
				task.Wait(int(d / 4))
				Kill(o)
			end)
		end
	end
	if indes == true then
		for _, o in ObjList(GROUP_INDES) do
			d = Dist(x, y, o.x, o.y)
			if d <= range then
				task.New(o, function()
					task.Wait(int(d / 4))
					Kill(o)
				end)
			end
		end
	end
end


--以速度v匀速移动给定路径road的函数
---@param o table @执行描绘的对象
---@param road  number[][] @按顺序排列好描绘坐标的点集{{x,y}, ...})
---@param v number @平均速度
---@param del boolean @描绘完是否自删
---@param setv boolean @描绘完是否匀速直线运动
function draw_road(o, road, v, del, setv)
	task.New(o, function()
		local s, a, count, countmax, ds = {}, {}, 1, #road, v
		for i = 1, countmax - 1 do
			if road[i][1] == road[i + 1][1] and road[i][2] == road[i + 1][2] then
				s[i] = 0
				a[i] = 0
			else
				s[i] = Dist(road[i][1], road[i][2], road[i + 1][1], road[i + 1][2])
				a[i] = Angle(road[i][1], road[i][2], road[i + 1][1], road[i + 1][2])
			end
		end
		o.x, o.y = road[1][1], road[1][2]
		while (count < countmax) do
			ds = v
			while (count < countmax and ds > s[count]) do
				ds = ds - s[count]
				count = count + 1
				o.x, o.y = road[count][1], road[count][2]
			end
			if count < countmax then
				s[count] = s[count] - ds
				o.x, o.y = o.x + ds * cos(a[count]), o.y + ds * sin(a[count])
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		end
		o.road_finish = true
		if del == true then
			Del(o)
		end
		if setv == true then
			SetV(o, v, a[countmax - 1])
		end
	end)
end

--拖影类及类方法，该类不推荐直接实例化，仅作为封闭类方法使用
do
	trail = Class(object)
	function trail:init(maxnum)
		self._trail = nil
		self._trail_off = 0 --手动调控开关拖影（有渐变动画），0为开，1为关
		self._trail_num = 1
		self.max_trail_num = maxnum or 10
		self._trail = {}
		self._trail[1] = {}
		self._trail[1]["img"] = self.img
		self._trail[1]["x"] = self.x
		self._trail[1]["y"] = self.y
		self._trail[1]["rot"] = self.rot
		self._trail[1]["alpha"] = 0
		self._blend = self._blend or "mul+alpha"
	end
	function trail:frame()
		self._trail[self.max_trail_num - self._trail_num] = {}
		self._trail[self.max_trail_num - self._trail_num]["img"] = self.img
		self._trail[self.max_trail_num - self._trail_num]["x"] = self.x
		self._trail[self.max_trail_num - self._trail_num]["y"] = self.y
		self._trail[self.max_trail_num - self._trail_num]["rot"] = self.rot
		self._trail[self.max_trail_num - self._trail_num]["alpha"] = self._a      --记录每帧自己贴图的状态
		for i = 1, self.max_trail_num do
			if i > self._trail_num then
				self._trail[self.max_trail_num - i + 1] = { img = self.img, x = self.x, y = self.y, rot = self.rot, alpha = self._a }
			else
				self._trail[self.max_trail_num - i + 1] = self._trail[self.max_trail_num - i]
			end
		end
		if self._trail_off == 1 then
			--拖影消失动画
			self._trail_num = max(self._trail_num - 1, 0)
		elseif self._trail_off == 0 then
			self._trail_num = min(self._trail_num + 1, self.max_trail_num - 1)
		end
	end
	function trail:render()
		local d = self.max_trail_num - self._trail_num + 2
		local al = 1
		local size = 1
		for i = d, self.max_trail_num do
			local t = self._trail[i]
			al = al - 1 / (self.max_trail_num - d + 1)
			size = size + 0.25 / (self.max_trail_num - d + 1)
			SetImageState(t["img"], self._blend, Color(t["alpha"] * (50 / 255) * al, 255, 255, 255))
			Render(t["img"], t["x"], t["y"], t["rot"], self.hscale * size, self.vscale * size)
		end
	end
end

--拖影类(需要主人对象)
local trail = Class(object)
function trail:init(master, maxnum, frame, img, size, blend, times, _a_rate, Isdsize)
	self.bound = false
	self.master = master
	self.alpha = (master._a or 255) * 80 / 255
	self.real_img = img or master.img --如果img参数为nil则使用主人的img
	self.img = self.real_img or self.master.img
	self.size = size or 1
	self.trail = {} --拖影表
	self.max = maxnum or 10
	self.frame = frame or 3
	self.co = { 255, 255, 255 } --留一个可以外部操作的接口co
	self.blend = blend or "mul+alpha"
	self.times = times or 99999
	self._a_rate = _a_rate or 1
	self.Isdsize = Isdsize
end
function trail:frame()
	if self.frame == 1 or self.timer % self.frame == 1 then
		if IsValid(self.master) and self.timer < self.times then
			local master = self.master
			self.x, self.y = master.x, master.y
			table.insert(self.trail, 1, { master.x, master.y, master.rot, master.hscale * self.size, master.vscale * self.size }) --更新主人当前图像状态
			if #self.trail > self.max then
				table.remove(self.trail)
			end
		else
			--即便主人不存在了，拖影也会保留一段时间渐渐消失
			self.vx, self.vy = self.dx, self.dy
			if #self.trail == 0 then
				Del(self)
			else
				table.remove(self.trail)
			end
		end
		self.img = self.real_img or (IsValid(self.master) and self.master.img or self.img) --如果img参数为nil则使用主人的img
	end
	--好像可以和上面合并，不过先搁置着，以后再来优化
	if IsValid(self.master) then
		self.alpha = self.master._a * self._a_rate
	elseif self.x > -384 and self.x < 384 and self.y < 448 and self.y > -448 then
		self.alpha = max(0, self.alpha - 2)
	end
end
function trail:render()
	local img = self.img
	local co = self.co
	local size = 0
	local dsize
	if self.Isdsize then
		dsize = -1 / self.max
	else
		dsize = 0
	end
	local alpha, d, n = 0, self.alpha / self.max, #self.trail
	for i = n, 1, -1 do
		local obj = self.trail[i]
		SetImageState(img, self.blend, Color(alpha, co[1], co[2], co[3]))
		Render(img, obj[1], obj[2], obj[3], obj[4] * size, obj[5] * size)
		alpha = alpha + d
		size = size + dsize
	end
end
egg.trail = trail

local road_sign = Class(object)
function road_sign:init(x, y, rot, co)
	self.x, self.y = x - 30 * cos(rot), y - 30 * sin(rot)
	self._vx, self._vy = 0.75 * cos(rot), 0.75 * sin(rot)
	self.rot = rot
	self._a = 0
	self.hscale, self.vscale = 0.8, 0.8
	self.group = GROUP_GHOST
	self.layer = LAYER_BG + 1
	self.bound = false
	self.hide = false
	self.img = "road_sign" .. co
	self._blend = "mul+add"
	--trail.init(self, 20)
end
function road_sign:frame()
	--trail.frame(self)
	if self.timer >= 80 and self.timer <= 90 then
		self._trail_off = 1
	elseif self.timer > 60 then
		Del(self)
	end
	if self.timer <= 40 then
		self.hscale, self.vscale = self.hscale - 0.01, self.vscale - 0.01
		self._a = self._a + 2
		self.x, self.y = self.x + self._vx, self.y + self._vy
	else
		self.hscale, self.vscale = self.hscale - 0.02, self.vscale - 0.02
		self._a = self._a - 4
		self.x, self.y = self.x + 0.5, self.y + 0.5
	end
end
function road_sign:render()
	--trail.render(self)
	SetImageState(self.img, self._blend, Color(self._a, 255, 255, 255))
	Render(self.img, self.x, self.y, self.rot, self.hscale, self.vscale)
end

--通用的路径显示obj
road_disp = Class(object)
function road_disp:init(x, y, road, co)
	self.x, self.y = x, y
	self.rot = 0
	self.co = co or 4
	self.navi = true
	self.group = GROUP_GHOST
	self.bound = false
	self.hide = false
	self.img = "img_void"
	draw_road(self, road, 14, false, true)
end
function road_disp:frame()
	task.Do(self)
	if self.timer >= 2 then
		New(road_sign, self.x, self.y, self.rot, self.co)
	end
	if self.timer >= 300 then
		Del(self)
	end
end

--创建一个移动的激光纹理(要放在对象的render函数里
---@param tex string 激光纹理名
---@param timer number 时间参数，控制激光纹理移动
---@param offset number 激光总长度
---@param length number 纹理长度
---@param width number 纹理宽度
---@param blend string 混合模式
---@param color table 颜色模式
local function CreateLaser(tex, x, y, a, timer, offset, length, width, blend, color)
	length, width = length or 256, width or 16
	blend = blend or "mul+add"
	color = color or Color(255, 255, 255, 255)
	local n = int(offset / 256) --循环数
	local trail_len = timer % length   --激光尾长（从使魔中发出的长度
	local endl = int(offset - n * length) --激光头长(接近offset的那一段

	width = width / 2 --激光宽度的一半
	local w_x = width * cos(a)
	local w_y = width * sin(a)

	local vx1, vy1, vx2, vy2, vx3, vy3
	--渲染循环的部分（激光尾部和激光身
	for i = 1, n do
		vx1 = x + (trail_len + length * (i - 1)) * cos(a)
		vy1 = y + (trail_len + length * (i - 1)) * sin(a)
		vx2 = x + length * i * cos(a)
		vy2 = y + length * i * sin(a)
		vx3 = x + length * (i - 1) * cos(a)
		vy3 = y + length * (i - 1) * sin(a)
		RenderTexture(
				tex, blend,
				{ vx1 - w_y, vy1 + w_x, 0.5, 0, 0, color },
				{ vx2 - w_y, vy2 + w_x, 0.5, length - trail_len, 0, color },
				{ vx2 + w_y, vy2 - w_x, 0.5, length - trail_len, 16, color },
				{ vx1 + w_y, vy1 - w_x, 0.5, 0, 16, color })
		RenderTexture(
				tex, blend,
				{ vx3 - w_y, vy3 + w_x, 0.5, length - trail_len, 0, color },
				{ vx1 - w_y, vy1 + w_x, 0.5, length, 0, color },
				{ vx1 + w_y, vy1 - w_x, 0.5, length, 16, color },
				{ vx3 + w_y, vy3 - w_x, 0.5, length - trail_len, 16, color })
	end

	--以下单独渲染头部（长度到达offset的那一段
	vx2 = x + (endl + length * n) * cos(a)
	vy2 = y + (endl + length * n) * sin(a)
	vx3 = x + length * n * cos(a)
	vy3 = y + length * n * sin(a)
	if trail_len <= endl then
		vx1 = x + (trail_len + length * n) * cos(a)
		vy1 = y + (trail_len + length * n) * sin(a)
		RenderTexture(
				tex, blend,
				{ vx1 - w_y, vy1 + w_x, 0.5, 0, 0, color },
				{ vx2 - w_y, vy2 + w_x, 0.5, endl - trail_len, 0, color },
				{ vx2 + w_y, vy2 - w_x, 0.5, endl - trail_len, 16, color },
				{ vx1 + w_y, vy1 - w_x, 0.5, 0, 16, color })
		RenderTexture(
				tex, blend,
				{ vx3 - w_y, vy3 + w_x, 0.5, length - trail_len, 0, color },
				{ vx1 - w_y, vy1 + w_x, 0.5, length, 0, color },
				{ vx1 + w_y, vy1 - w_x, 0.5, length, 16, color },
				{ vx3 + w_y, vy3 - w_x, 0.5, length - trail_len, 16, color })
	else
		RenderTexture(
				tex, blend,
				{ vx3 - w_y, vy3 + w_x, 0.5, length - trail_len, 0, color },
				{ vx2 - w_y, vy2 + w_x, 0.5, endl + length - trail_len, 0, color },
				{ vx2 + w_y, vy2 - w_x, 0.5, endl + length - trail_len, 16, color },
				{ vx3 + w_y, vy3 - w_x, 0.5, length - trail_len, 16, color })
	end
end
egg.CreateLaser = CreateLaser

--判断某个对象是否在激光范围内
---@param w number 激光的宽度
---@param o table 参与检测的对象
local function IsInLaser(x, y, a, w, o)
	local a1 = a - Angle(x, y, o.x, o.y)
	if a % 180 == 90 then
		if abs(o.x - x) < ((o.a + o.b + w) / 2) and cos(a1) >= 0 then
			return true
		else
			return false
		end
	else
		local A = tan(a)
		local C = y - A * x
		if abs(A * o.x - o.y + C) / hypot(A, 1) < ((o.a + o.b + w) / 2) and cos(a1) >= 0 then
			return true
		else
			return false
		end
	end
end
egg.IsInLaser = IsInLaser

--反弹
local function rebound(self, count, times, func)
	local flag = 0
	local t = 0
	count = count or 1
	times = times or 99999
	task.New(self, function()
		while (t < times and flag < count) do
			if (self.x <= -384 or self.x >= 384) then
				self.vx = -self.vx
				flag = flag + 1
				if func then
					func(self)
				end --反弹时触发的函数，参数只限于传入对象本身
			elseif (self.y <= -448 or self.y >= 448) then
				self.vy = -self.vy
				flag = flag + 1
				if func then
					func(self)
				end
			end
			task.Wait(1)
			t = t + 1
		end
	end)
end
egg.rebound = rebound
--碰了墙还会转得更快的傻吊反弹
local function sprebound(self, count, times, domiga, dv)
	local flag = 0
	local t = 0
	task.New(self, function()
		while (t < times and flag < count) do
			if (self.x <= -384 or self.x >= 384) then
				if self.x <= -384 then
					dv = -abs(dv)
				else
					dv = abs(dv)
				end
				self.vx = -self.vx + dv
				flag = flag + 1
				self.omiga = self.omiga + domiga
			elseif (self.y <= -448 or self.y >= 448) then
				if self.y <= -448 then
					dv = -abs(dv)
				else
					dv = abs(dv)
				end
				self.vy = -self.vy + dv
				flag = flag + 1
				self.omiga = self.omiga + domiga
			end
			t = t + 1
			task.Wait(1)
		end
	end)
end

--使转速均匀变化，可设置最值
local function ChOmiga(self, domiga, momiga, times)
	task.New(self, function()
		if domiga < 0 then
			for _ = 1, times do
				self.omiga = max(momiga, self.omiga + domiga)
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		else
			for _ = 1, times do
				self.omiga = min(momiga, self.omiga + domiga)
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		end
	end)
end

--可叠加的转速变化事件
local function AddSimStrChO(self, o0, o1, t0)
	task.New(self, function()
		self.omiga = self.omiga + o0
		local d = (o1 - o0) / t0
		for _ = 1, t0 do
			self.omiga = self.omiga + d
			task.Wait(1)
		end
	end)
end
egg.AddSimStrChO = AddSimStrChO
egg.sprebound = sprebound
egg.ChOmiga = ChOmiga

local function MoveWith(self, mst, r, a0, t0, t1, IsnTask)
	--跟随
	local a
	if IsnTask then
		--如果不是task
		if t0 then
			--是否要出场动作
			local dr = r / t0
			r = 0
			for _ = 1, t0 do
				if IsValid(mst) then
					r = r + dr
					a = mst.rot + a0
					self.x, self.y = mst.x + r * cos(a), mst.y + r * sin(a)
					self.rot = a
				else
					break
				end
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		end
		for _ = 1, t1 or _infinite do
			if IsValid(mst) then
				a = mst.rot + a0
				self.x, self.y = mst.x + r * cos(a), mst.y + r * sin(a)
				self.rot = a
			else
				break
			end
			task.Wait(1)
		end
	else
		task.New(self, function()
			if t0 then
				--是否要出场动作
				local dr = r / t0
				r = 0
				for _ = 1, t0 do
					if IsValid(mst) then
						r = r + dr
						a = mst.rot + a0
						self.x, self.y = mst.x + r * cos(a), mst.y + r * sin(a)
						self.rot = a
					else
						Del(self)
					end
					task.Wait(1)
				end
			end
			for _ = 1, t1 or _infinite do
				if IsValid(mst) then
					a = mst.rot + a0
					self.x, self.y = mst.x + r * cos(a), mst.y + r * sin(a)
					self.rot = a
				else
					Del(self)
				end
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		end)
	end
end
egg.MoveWith = MoveWith

--在t时间内以一定紧密度p追踪目标(不可叠加
---@param o table 执行事件的对象
---@param target table 被追踪的对象
---@param v0 number 初始速度
---@param v1 number 最终速度
---@param t number 追踪时间
---@param p number 追踪强度
---@param a table 接收第一位数据作为初始角度，且此时不以o.rot为方向
local function AimTo(o, target, v0, v1, t, p, a)
	if not a then
		task.New(o, function()
			o.navi = true
			local dv, da = (v1 - v0) / t --求每帧自身方向与自身和目标方向角度的差值
			for _ = 1, t do
				da = (Angle(o, target) - o.rot) % 360
				if da > 180 then
					da = da - 360
				end
				o.rot = o.rot + da * p
				v0 = v0 + dv
				SetV(o, v0, o.rot)
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		end)
	else
		task.New(o, function()
			local a0 = a[1]
			local dv, da = (v1 - v0) / t --求每帧自身方向与自身和目标方向角度的差值
			for _ = 1, t do
				da = (Angle(o, target) - a0) % 360
				if da > 180 then
					da = da - 360
				end
				a0 = a0 + da * p
				v0 = v0 + dv
				SetV(o, v0, a0)
				task.Wait(1)
			end
		end)
	end
end
egg.AimTo = AimTo
